should you mix business with pleasure a  lot of entrepreneurs have a limiting  belief that you go to your business just  for business and then you have your life  just your life and I'm of the opinion I  believe that everything gets stronger  when you can mix those things together  if you can bring more of your personal  life and your personal beliefs into your  business you'll have a lot more fun  you'll be more fulfilled from it people  will connect you better because it's not  just a company now it's a it's a person  and if you can bring more of your  business to your personal life you'll  find that people can relate to you  better can understand what you go  through can maybe give you some  connections it's not like you're you're  forcing yourself on people I'm not  saying you should be out you know and  every personal dinner you're having with  friends hard selling them on what you're  selling you know and I don't believe  that you need to be in your in your own  business always just talking about your  personal life but there's a mix you  don't have to keep them separated and I  think as entrepreneurs our business  lives and our personal lives are so  intertwined and that's a special  relationship that if you take them apart  I think will hurt you because what  you're doing your business around is  hopefully an extension of who you are  and you're doing your business because  you're passionate about something you  really believe in something so that's  that's a part of you that's like your  second leg that that's a part of what  you're all about so why would you want  to hide that why would you feel ashamed  of of telling people about that and your  personal life if you can bring that  element to your business people will  connect with you better and will be more  likely to bar for you because people  like buying from people and not from  companies just an example of how these  things are so mixed together I run these  mastermind groups here in Toronto and  every month a group of entrepreneurs we  get together we talk about our  businesses we try to help each other out  at the end of the meeting we'll go to  the computer and enter in our goals of  what we want to have happen for the next  month and there's always two business  goals and one personal goal  because our lives are so intertwined  then they started off as three business  goals and the member said hey what about  adding some personal goals in on here  too and it could be something as simple  as you know show my wife how much I love  her or you know run three times a week  or you know go learn salsa dancing  something like that but but it's so  mixed up into what makes us happy right  if you want to be happy as an  entrepreneur you need to have your  personal life happy and you need to have  your business life happy if your  business is suffering you're not gonna  be happy as an entrepreneur if you're if  your home life sucks  you're not gonna be happy either and so  part of being a happy entrepreneur is  getting everything working together and  sharing that with people with the people  in your life makes them understand you  better and connect you better so all  this is as a result of a question a  really long question that came in from  one of my newsletter readers Andrea and  Andrea basically has a whole bunch of  businesses she has a new book she's got  all these things going on and she wants  to launch her own personal website and  his wondering can she share her business  stuff on her personal website or should  she just keep it separate and in my mind  I don't know how you keep it separate I  mean you so you want to make it tasteful  not just say hey go buy my book it's the  greatest thing ever  but the book is part of you right like  your experiences in your personal life  to led to creating this book so why  wouldn't you want to share it right  bring yourself into your business and  your business into your person like you  mix them up you'll feel better people  will understand you more you'll be  happier and you'll make more money  believe for those of you watching like  the video give it a thumbs up below let  me know what you think do you agree  disagree leave a comment below have a  question leave it in the comment section  I'll give you a reply thank you guys so  much if you want to see more videos like  this please subscribe below and I'll see  you soon  you
 

